	(text "DC INPUT, 7-24 V (12 V nominal)\nPWR_SW1: external power switch in the positive lead (bridge it if unused).\nQ101: reverse-polarity protection (body diode conducts first, then the channel turns on);\nD102 limits its gate-source voltage. D101 clamps input surges. R102/R103: VIN to ADC1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
