	(text "BUCK CONVERTER MODULES (off-board, on terminals; inputs rated >= 28 V)\nBUCK_5V1: fixed 5 V, >= 1 A. Feeds the Pico (through D103) and the atomizers.\nBUCK_LASER1: adjustable, >= 4 A. Set ~6.0 V for config A (Sony) or ~5.0 V for config B (Osram).\nFirmware checks LASER_RAIL on ADC0 against the CONFIG jumper."
